node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ⚠ DO NOT ignore content/articles/_embeddings.json.
# The reference repo ignored it; that was wrong. The dashboard reads its COMMIT AGE
# to report embedding-cache staleness, so an ignored cache makes that panel lie —
# and CI re-embeds the whole corpus every run instead of reusing it. Commit it.
# See 14-PORTING-NOTES.md §D.

# ⚠ DO NOT ignore site/ or .github/workflows/ either. They are DERIVED, but
# derived is not the same as disposable: CI builds the blog without an API key
# and Vercel deploys straight from the repo, so both must be committed.
# "Committed" and "hand-made" are different things (§02).

# The hosted build is regenerated by `npm run portal -- --self-extracting`.
portal/dist/
